{"description":"Verify a direct Base USDC artifact payment and the buyer's separate zero-USDC wallet-control proof, then deliver the retained artifact. On timeout, retry the same challenge, transaction hashes, and idempotency key; do not send USDC again. The transaction hash alone is not enough to claim a purchase. Successful delivery includes exact delivery.bodyBase64 bytes and private delivery.artifactProof for commitment verification.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"challengeId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"idempotencyKey":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,128}$","type":"string"},"identityTransactionHash":{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{64}$","type":"string"},"merchantId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"method":{"enum":["approve_zero","transfer_zero"],"type":"string"},"offerId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"payer":{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$","type":"string"},"paymentTransactionHash":{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["merchantId","offerId","payer","challengeId","method","identityTransactionHash","paymentTransactionHash","idempotencyKey"],"type":"object"},"name":"complete_prepared_artifact_transfer"}
